      "text": "knowledge/specs/    approved behavior. owner-approved edits only.\nknowledge/memory/   facts + decisions. write via the gate (scene 4).\nknowledge/index.md  GENERATED - rebuild it, never hand-edit.\nwork-items/         active work. the tracker owns status.",
