    {
      "type": "text", "id": "s2_d5", "x": 1160, "y": 812, "width": 640, "height": 33,
      "text": "\"I could not find it. I searched specs, decisions, transcripts.\" (FR-038)\nempty stays empty - never padded with recent-but-unrelated stuff (FR-033)",
