    {
      "type": "text", "id": "s2_deep", "x": 1110, "y": 990, "width": 700, "height": 66,
      "text": "high-stakes answer? do not trust the summary: open the full record and\nfollow its provenance links back to the original evidence (FR-034).\nsmarter search add-ons (embeddings etc.) only if they measurably help,\nand never past the privacy boundary without consent (FR-037).",
